VirtualHost configuration:
*:80                   is a NameVirtualHost
         port 80 namevhost a.example.com (/etc/apache2/a.conf:1)
                 alias www.a.example.com port 80 namevhost other.example.com (/etc/apache2/o.conf:1) Define: x
         port 80 namevhost b.example.com (/etc/apache2/b.conf:1)
